  "criticalEvidence": [
    "TimeModule27252 priority60; Initialize27253 replaces countdown, loop and Unity dictionaries in source order, resets lastMinute/lastTime/timeId, sets instance initialized flag then calls callback. Constructor lists survive reinitialization. Static IsInit is distinct from the instance flag.",
    "Start27254 registers GF_NewGamePause then GF_GameFocus with no deduplication. Pause27256 typed bool args[0], true iterates live loop values and calls GamePause; false does nothing. Focus27257 assigns shared static focus. Update27255 updates local DateTime, checks countdowns with Unity realtime, then loop timers with scaled/unscaled delta, then Unity timers. No instance initialized/focus blanket gate.",
    "ClearTimer27258 clears countdown maps then loop removal ids/loop map then Unity maps and resets selected timestamps/id. Does not destroy loop callbacks or clear pending additions/Unity removal lists, lastMillisecond or realtime. Shutdown27291 removes each source listener once, ClearTimer then initialized=false. Exceptions preserve prefix mutations.",
    "Loop Add27259/27260 increments shared id, constructs helper3535, queues it, autoPlay true writes paused=false but false leaves same defaultfalse; log count observes live map after queue. Wrapper27262/27263 order verified against parameter metadata. Check27261 removes queued ids then activates queued helpers with Dictionary.Add, then two live Values passes AddTimes and Check. Pending work created during callbacks waits until next call. Source generic usage3956496 resolves Dictionary.Add10512.",
    "Loop helper27298..27306: AddTimes returns on paused/unfocused; unscaled>1 is ignored, scaled spikes accepted. Both elapsed/total accumulate. Check does not consult pause/focus; >=step resets elapsed before one callback passing configured step, discards overshoot. GamePause if enabled invokes with actual elapsed (integer truncates) then resets elapsed after callback, no paused flag change. Destroy nulls callbacks only. Pause callback sees elapsed; GetLoopTimerValue returns truncated total; Reset optionally clears total. Remove queues id before callback and never removes immediately.",
    "Unity Add27285 queues main one-shot plus optional separate looping1second helper sharing id; AddUnityEverySecond27286 queues only1second helper. Helper3536 AddTimer reads Unity scaled/unscaled delta, returns if complete/unfocused or unscaled>1, adds elapsed then invokes every callback before testing live elapsed>=duration. Complete invokes callback first, then live loop flag selects subtract duration versus setcomplete. One callback per step; overshoot retained for loop.",
    "CheckUnity27288 merges cached removal ids into complete list with Contains dedupe, clears cache, removes all three maps by id, clears complete list, activates queued lists in main/second/minute order, each Dictionary.Add (usage3956548 resolves10512). Tick order everysecond/main/everyminute, separate live Values enumerators. Only main loop enqueues IsComplete ids; removal occurs next check. Adds during callbacks stay pending; callbacks requesting removal do not prevent later same-frame passes. Source conditional queue Clear only occurs for nonempty pending/cache lists.",
    "All conversions preserve WASM signed-int overflow behavior. Callback exceptions propagate; no fabricated cancellation, retry cleanup, pause behavior, catchup or queue normalization."
  ],
